homelab-common (0.1.26) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Health: mount_health_route now also sets up per-app HTTP metrics
    (new mount_metrics_route) -- every health-instrumented Mojolicious app
    publishes homelab_http_requests_total / _duration_seconds /
    _in_flight + homelab_app_up/uptime as node_exporter textfile *.prom
    files (per-worker, multi-worker-safe), with no new port/scrape/firewall.
    No-op where the textfile dir isn't present.

 -- Jeff Gardner <mailmasker-api01@forge.name>  Tue, 30 Sep 2026 22:50:00 -0500

